{"script": "scenario_18.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「咦？我不是说了\\n　考试期间可以不用做便当了吗？」", "text_idx": 158, "plain": "「咦？我不是说了　考试期间可以不用做便当了吗？」", "plain_idx": 159, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_18.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「这是爱理的便当」", "text_idx": 161, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0352", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_18.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是帮我复习的谢礼。\\n　考试，考得意外地好」", "text_idx": 163, "plain": "「是帮我复习的谢礼。　考试，考得意外地好」", "plain_idx": 164, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0353", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_18.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……是么」", "text_idx": 166, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_18.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「就差一点……就差一点了哦熊喵……」", "text_idx": 168, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0282", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_18.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": "熊喵", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「溜～溜～」", "text_idx": 172, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "pn0060", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_18.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……为什么我出去转换下心情，\\n　还要看见那只动物啊」", "text_idx": 175, "plain": "「……为什么我出去转换下心情，　还要看见那只动物啊」", "plain_idx": 176, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0550", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_18.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不要紧的，小熊喵是安静类型的」", "text_idx": 179, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu0182", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_18.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「反而更不能掉以轻心啊……\\n　而且考试也还没考完，必须绷紧神经」", "text_idx": 182, "plain": "「反而更不能掉以轻心啊……　而且考试也还没考完，必须绷紧神经」", "plain_idx": 183, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0551", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_18.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「话说回来，考完试后\\n　大家一起举办一个庆功会，如何？」", "text_idx": 185, "plain": "「话说回来，考完试后　大家一起举办一个庆功会，如何？」", "plain_idx": 186, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_18.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「听起来不错呢！\\n　我又对未来燃起希望了！」", "text_idx": 187, "plain": "「听起来不错呢！　我又对未来燃起希望了！」", "plain_idx": 188, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0283", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_18.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好，那就回去吧」", "text_idx": 190, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0552", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_18.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "——就这样。", "text_idx": 192, "plain": "——就这样。", "plain_idx": 192, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_18.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好了，考试到此结束」", "text_idx": 193, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mc0087", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_18.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "通用", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「辛苦了～～～！」", "text_idx": 197, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "全班同学", "alt_speaker_idx": 196, "voice": "go040", "char_id": "汎用"}]}
{"script": "scenario_18.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "在这严肃且热闹的氛围里，\\n四天转瞬即逝。", "text_idx": 199, "plain": "在这严肃且热闹的氛围里，四天转瞬即逝。", "plain_idx": 200, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
